{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "98969bc23ac95e79507f03a5cc3c6b857d9098a702ecc42cdea8ed1fe2ef1eaa", "ja": "メイクス、ハピネス、なのです☆", "zh": "创造幸福哦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "dcb6c94d46c9148e733507b65e997865d150762d17aeafe2c6a848ae51e3d5d7", "ja": "プロデューサーと未来、美也は、地方公演の\n準備をしていた。そして外では、再び昴達が\n野球をしていた。やがてホームランが炸裂、\n閃光が辺りを包み……光が収まった時、そこ\nにはプリンセスが立っていたのだった。", "zh": "制作人与未来、美也正在为地方公演\n做准备。而在外面，昴她们又在\n打棒球。不久，一记全垒打炸裂，闪光笼罩了四周……\n当光芒散去时，那里站着一位公主。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "283087ec471a815e13f1dc223ebcd4ae857627c56a752915e7e4d60368882682", "ja": "（今日は劇場で、地方公演のインタビュー取材が\nある予定だが、まつりの記憶はまだ戻らない……）", "zh": "（今天预定要在剧场接受地方公演的采访，不过，まつり还没有恢复记忆……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "84197a24a3ffe6cd515ebbfe1fbac39d1362701955d990e39962b9c60f320cf6", "ja": "（撮影はいいとして、インタビューは……\n他の仕事がある事にして、紙で回答するか……うーん）", "zh": "（拍摄倒是没问题，可采访就……就说还有别的工作要做，用纸面回答吧……嗯——）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "aa989f76971eb99d148ab695a9c17132e8392bb5796f0edc6b0e3e06d716f65b", "ja": "地方公演の取材かぁ……えへへ。地方公演って、\nなんだか修学旅行みたいで楽しみだな～♪", "zh": "地方巡演的采访啊……嘿嘿。总觉得地方巡演\n就像修学旅行一样，好让人期待呀～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "03299b9dbbfc139d1cba42df65583b1f26d1aeb5c74c3a534f8c976176a315b1", "ja": "うふふ、そうですな～。{$P$}さん、\n地方公演は、今より暖かくなっているでしょうか～？", "zh": "呵呵，是啊～{$P$}先生，到地方公演的时候，会不会比现在暖和一些呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1004_p", "source_sha256": "7cabb5b81f70a6c650e56922693fcd5448a5373e9875c64726508a5014cf9bab", "ja": "そうだな、少しは暖かくなっているといいんだけど……\nん？　外がにぎやかだな。みんなで野球をしてるのか。", "zh": "是啊，要是能暖和一点就好了……\n嗯？外面挺热闹的。大家是在一起打棒球吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "74f09030f89e5e0ee4f431c2f0e135850f4e64f21c832ac81372355ffd421715", "ja": "いっくぞー！　それーっ！", "zh": "看招——！接招——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "a112a33b0f6a7588df4a5da08382aed298984984af7e774440a387ae18093860", "ja": "……よっ、と！\nうまいうまいー！　環、ナーイスピッチング！", "zh": "……嘿哟！\n投得好投得好——！环，投球漂亮！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "0b16eccf2af7492e07de183607b53d1afaaadcfa83a7eae2308bd28732ef704e", "ja": "ふんふん、なるほど……よしっ！\n今日の投球、今ので見切ったぜ！", "zh": "哼哼，原来如此……好！\n今天的投球，我已经看透了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "95e17c6efd22be727a112320917517fbfcff168cb420a867e948ff8fe12fb87e", "ja": "環、今日こそ三振とろうねっ！\nあっ、すばるんもホームランがんばれー！", "zh": "环，今天一定要拿下三振哦！\n啊，昴昴也要加油打出全垒打——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "65d6644c7b324e2b88a1ca4021cca0da6b0ebafeb8a19cfe03cfad186fc87c44", "ja": "すばる、いくぞー！", "zh": "昴，来吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1011_047sub", "source_sha256": "8c1014da1e8a3b600df5100fb9493dc9a7a157bb7b7b858e8e53d72a5c6f1148", "ja": "来い、環ー！\n今日もホームランをお見舞いしてやるぜ！", "zh": "来吧，环——！\n今天也要赏你一记全垒打！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "c747a68188179d1c521e32d484c86c0002cd2a785f69aa299de971542129ef73", "ja": "させないぞー！\nいくぞー、石切りまきゅう3号！　てやーっ！", "zh": "不让你得逞——！\n看招，石切魔球3号！嘿呀——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1013_se", "source_sha256": "dd26a3a0544f0732eed4a37953f4932ae6c57882fd49c5d490f1c48c6fff6034", "ja": "ビューーーンッ！！", "zh": "呼——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1014_047sub", "source_sha256": "37a151da6ea54463d3395685587231da333d823c397c73123a8fbd23efb5bd29", "ja": "へへっ、ボールが止まってみえるぜ！\n……くらえ、魔球返しーっ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，球看起来都像停住了一样！\n……接招，魔球反击——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1015_se", "source_sha256": "e0e13d9adab526304ff63e12bbd810d082123826bb65b7df9c2bee4d558d0041", "ja": "カアアアアァァーンッ！！！", "zh": "锵——！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "e7cc4687a996f27722e96f8c63ce7eae4fd11e6cb601c6569dcab563f11d0fea", "ja": "わっ！？　……ビックリした～！\n今、すごく光ったけど……なんだろう？", "zh": "哇！？……吓我一跳～！\n刚才发出了好刺眼的光……是怎么回事啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1017_042miy", "source_sha256": "87a7efbcae6df8048a23a85669c66458b668afceccf2f58ee85ff0da3a3bdb54", "ja": "それに、大きな音もしましたよ～。\n何だったんでしょう～？", "zh": "而且还发出了很大的声音呢～。\n刚才究竟是什么呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1018_p", "source_sha256": "8fc4fc0ac817f1471419464e98dbe6434e8359ec210d362fc9e1e0be761f5c70", "ja": "あれ？　海美たちの様子が……あっ！\nあの真ん中で倒れてるのは、まつりじゃないか！？", "zh": "咦？海美她们的情况……啊！\n倒在正中间的那个人，不是まつり吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1020_040tam", "source_sha256": "8272511c2732730a9cfb297350feb4ad912f5a473bff6f1bf89bb6d0595f0712", "ja": "まつり、大丈夫ー！？\nねえ、まつりー！　起きてよー！", "zh": "真，没事吧——！？\n喂，真——！快醒醒啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1021_029umi", "source_sha256": "7dcf5d507b3df2d3439bb3a9088026dc26637b73672382bfbf49774b545a10b0", "ja": "そうだ、救急車！　こういう時は、救急車だよね！\nえっと……えーと……うわーん、救急車って何番～！？", "zh": "对了，叫救护车！这种时候就该叫救护车吧！\n那个……呃……哇啊——救护车要打几号来着～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1022_047sub", "source_sha256": "aa97a5ffd0b19a40d6e95b3d79b5d33446fba872a392ad1adbb0273578332a2f", "ja": "どうしよう、オレのせいだよな！？　ううっ……\nまつりー！　目を覚ましてくれよー！", "zh": "怎么办，都是我的错吧！？呜呜……\n茉莉——！你醒醒啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1023_021mat", "source_sha256": "e144c1134d79f001b5fca59ec00c673b969769f59145bc08daa92a0da39bb090", "ja": "…………ほ？", "zh": "…………哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1024_047sub", "source_sha256": "40a1d60c8881e75c61cb4c41d23388c2e33f0b588e59fea46c7a0e8bcefc8c22", "ja": "まつり！！", "zh": "茉莉！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1025_029umi", "source_sha256": "0b20d3b2c5865e2bd18a387275dfe14efbfd987a257211a1f97504c5eaeae24b", "ja": "まつりん！", "zh": "小祭！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1026_040tam", "source_sha256": "94c6b76a8c8bb84046c29da58f31350a4db2d4b80f533168c430685dcc1e6eb5", "ja": "まつりー！", "zh": "小祭——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1027_021mat", "source_sha256": "7c80e2624c8fe55abf844a90b6dcf9aa52a5627b17b3cd33db4ec94c352e0f46", "ja": "ふう……おや？　昴ちゃん、どうかしたのですか？\n海美ちゃんと環ちゃんも……何を泣いているのです？", "zh": "呼……咦？昴，你怎么了？\n海美和环也是……怎么都哭起来了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1028_047sub", "source_sha256": "51b66b17295762063744cf7f85b627f2150e402f3ff59a68412a9531960e70d4", "ja": "だ、だってさ！　オレが打った後に倒れてたから、\nまつりにボールが当たったんじゃないかと思って……！", "zh": "可、可是！因为我打出去之后你就倒下了，我还以为是球打到小真了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1029_021mat", "source_sha256": "35463758cab36083817cc96c0dad40702ff4cce3c68b5fdba0a4e94941b0c52b", "ja": "ほ？　……たしかに、何かが当たった気がするのです。\nでもそれは、ボールではないのです。", "zh": "嗯？……确实，感觉好像有什么撞到了我。\n不过那不是球。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1030_021mat", "source_sha256": "f9ad56472a7bd6338f25e1220ecfad3837a49bfdb3f461c5153373b3c0b1d945", "ja": "まつりにぶつかったのは、お星さまなのです♪\nその証拠に、ピカッと光ったのですよ！", "zh": "撞到小祭的，是一颗星星哦♪\n证据就是，它还闪闪发光呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1031_029umi", "source_sha256": "fc28777523974461ee7c2825259409e93fd614d8eb102384bd5b12ac594c4bdb", "ja": "えーっ！？\nちょっと何言ってるかわかんないよ、まつりん！？", "zh": "诶——！？\n等下，你说什么我完全听不懂啦，玛茨琳！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1032_040tam", "source_sha256": "277d6cb3819238d66e00cced21d46bb2b51021ddf31bdb7f6850acbb0f7a04b5", "ja": "まつり……だいじょうぶ？\n病院に行くなら、たまきもついていってあげる！", "zh": "茉莉……你没事吧？\n要是去医院的话，环也陪你一起去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1033_021mat", "source_sha256": "184c9d07768c4c27432b0c9d883911e4c70a2af2c2291a11ee00d7b238303264", "ja": "みんな、失礼なのですよ！　……というか、昴ちゃん！\nボールが人に当たると、でんじゃらす！なのです。", "zh": "大家真是失礼！……不对，昴亲！球要是砸到人，可是很危险的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1034_021mat", "source_sha256": "2c2f1fd20f2f8d9472d172f04e40517fdb20368d907aefdfec791a9a5a0367ed", "ja": "野球をする時は、周りに気をつけるのですよ？\n姫とのお約束なのです。……ね？", "zh": "打棒球的时候，要注意周围哦？这是和姬的约定。……好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1035_047sub", "source_sha256": "878f11a63b6510a7574effded5aeb9989aa60ef0941318eb2997fedc8dceb131", "ja": "お、おう、わかった！　約束するよ！", "zh": "哦、哦，知道了！我保证！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1036_p", "source_sha256": "35a60c71f16d1b57d18724569f514f91938b4b101edee5486793040c17c025b9", "ja": "まつりー！　……あっ、まつり！\nよかった、無事だったんだな！　ケガはないか！？", "zh": "茉莉——！　……啊，茉莉！\n太好了，你没事啊！没受伤吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1037_014mir", "source_sha256": "4c4a0109029f230fb178845f0d82d81c3190c37a128f489948a4740bcbc4e14b", "ja": "わーん！　まつりちゃん、死んじゃヤだよ～！！\n私たち、まだいっしょに公演やってないよ～！", "zh": "呜哇——！茉莉，不要死啊～！！\n我们都还没有一起办过公演呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1038_021mat", "source_sha256": "5895c51e3659716c4539b4ef644764bb6637f915495bab9da6f91fdc374ba6f7", "ja": "{$P$}さん、それに未来ちゃんまで、\nどうしたのです？　姫はピンピンしてるのですよ。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，还有未来，\n你们怎么了？公主精神得很哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1039_042miy", "source_sha256": "c957c9ddabb0b0be290e6ffcfb2487c03da809a086a28962779f5d27df785c0c", "ja": "おや～？　……いつものまつりちゃんですね～。\nもしかして、記憶が戻ったのでしょうか～？", "zh": "哎呀～？……是平时的公主殿下呢～。\n难道说，记忆恢复了吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1040_p", "source_sha256": "262dc7f27ebd2f760893ef89c4fd54dacdcb9e28c3f0730b0886bda06e2b0d51", "ja": "あっ！　言われてみれば、確かに……。", "zh": "啊！听你这么一说，确实……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1041_014mir", "source_sha256": "4af93fc16b9aa721bdbd43388d8ed536cdcc90a543cb53cc3d0738d8beca0206", "ja": "ほ、本当だ！\n……うわ～ん！　まつりちゃんが元に戻ったー！！", "zh": "真、真的！\n……呜哇——！小茉莉恢复原样了——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1042_021mat", "source_sha256": "dcf0d1027523c034c69ee33c7478475fe71fce80e36bd07c26271e32490aabd1", "ja": "未来ちゃん、どうして泣くのです？\n……美也ちゃん、これはどういうことなのです？", "zh": "未来亲，你为什么要哭呢？\n……美也亲，这是怎么回事呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1043_042miy", "source_sha256": "fc614d878fc836af0a63abb0df32c5d7d4fbb8a1e98ffea6fe590c63e497e849", "ja": "未来ちゃんが泣いてるのは、うれしいからですよ～。\nというわけで、まつりちゃん、おかえりなさい～。", "zh": "未来哭是因为高兴呀～所以，茉莉，欢迎回来～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1044_021mat", "source_sha256": "a59292dcb806c373ee8e228ef38d6bc416afd59fbd941c04063853c75844ddc6", "ja": "ただいま……なのです？\nほ？　これはいったい、どういうことなのです……？", "zh": "我回来了……是这样吗？\n呼？这到底是怎么回事呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_05_1045_p", "source_sha256": "3d8070bd0b2639f0d16dcfefd0aee27a8f3b8bec20707673a9d38d1a3df75449", "ja": "（理由は不明だが、まつりの記憶が戻ったようだ。\nケガもないようだし……ひとまず良かったな！）", "zh": "（虽然理由不明，但茉莉的记忆似乎恢复了。\n看起来也没有受伤……总之太好了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
